[I] A Library for Generating Text, XML, JSON, and HTML Output

[T] The libxo library allows an application to generate text, XML, JSON, and
[T] HTML output using a common set of function calls. The application decides
[T] at run time which output style should be produced.

[U] https://juniper.github.io/libxo/libxo-manual.html

